{"id":"msg_m_ex_talentum_01","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_talentum","label":"Talentum · Group"},"label":"1. Could everyone do me a favor, please?","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"msg_m_ex_talentum_02","speakers":{"rupee":"Rupee","yan":"Yan","dolla":"Dolla"},"icons":{"rupee":"si_c200_00_s","yan":"si_c201_00_s","dolla":"si_c202_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_1","text":"Could everyone do me a favor, please?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_2","text":"Before I tell you what it is, could you promise to hear me out? >.<","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_3","text":"Seriously! Just this time T_T","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_4","text":"This is my lifelong wish ><","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_5","text":"Heh, you crack me up.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"dolla","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_6","text":"Stop teasing us. If you must, flirt with those consumers.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_7","text":"... Hmph.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_8","text":"I knew it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_9","text":"You're so ruthless.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_10","text":"Sweetie, you will hear me out, right??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_11","text":"My lifelong wish!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_12","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_12","text":"Certainly.","jump":"m_ex_talentum_01_14"},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_13","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_13","text":"No harm to listen.","jump":"m_ex_talentum_01_14"},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_14","text":"Ah, here's the thing...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_15","text":"This time, YVONNE is selling an authentic designer bag.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_16","text":"Only 30 bags will be released from 3:00 PM tomorrow.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_17","text":"And online booking is required. Lots of people want this bag so it becomes a rush.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_18","text":"So I need you guys to place an order for me with your accounts.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_19","text":"I've asked many people for help,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_20","text":"but they all plan to buy one just for themselves. So I can only count on you guys.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_21","text":"So, Sweetie~","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_22","text":"Ugh, how can I put this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_23","text":"Can't you just find an online shopping agent to do this for you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_24","text":"Why bother us, and Rookie, with this trifle?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"dolla","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_25","text":"Maybe she wants to save more money for something else.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_26","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_27","text":"Yep.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_28","text":"You're right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_29","text":"Is there something wrong with my idea?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_30","text":"I have the right to splurge myself with the money I earned, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_31","text":"You do.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_32","text":"!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_33","text":"See!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_34","text":"You all saw that, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_35","text":"Sweetie's on my side.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_36","text":"Why are you guys so heartless? T_T","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"dolla","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_37","text":"Do you really have no clue?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"dolla","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_38","text":"You always ask us to help you","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"dolla","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_39","text":"with such things every week.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_40","text":"Ooh...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_41","text":"Is that my fault?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_42","text":"That's because there are new arrivals every week.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_43","text":"That's the fault of those luxury brands!!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_44","text":"Okay. Fine.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_45","text":"We'll do it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"dolla","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_talentum_01_46","text":"We'll place an order for you one last time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_talentum_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","